      "description": "Fill comparto placeholders 'ND' and '--' from the amministrazione lookup mapping.",
      "rationale": "comparto holds placeholder encodings 'ND' and '--' (91 records) where the true sector is derivable from amministrazione via the mined imputation hint (purity 0.99, coverage 0.98). The cross-column violations c8_v1..c8_v20 all stem from these placeholders. Replacing the placeholders with the mapped sector recovers the correct value deterministically.",
